<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux says Euro demand near bottom.</title>
<headline>Electrolux says Euro demand near bottom.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish household appliance maker Electrolux AB's chief executive said on Friday that European demand has probably bottomed out and predicted an upturn in demand.</p>
</text>
